const text: LessonText[][] = [[{"say":"Theme one, identities, is about who we are: lifestyles, health, beliefs and language. Let's build the language to talk about it.","blocks":[{"t":"key","text":"Describe yourself with ser (permanent traits: Soy alto, soy colombiano) and estar (states and location: Estoy cansado, estoy en casa)."},{"t":"p","text":"Talk about routines with reflexive verbs: me levanto, me ducho, me acuesto. Express opinions: creo que…, en mi opinión…, me parece que…"},{"t":"p","text":"Topics: estilos de vida (lifestyles), salud y bienestar (health and well-being), creencias y valores (beliefs and values), subculturas, and lengua e identidad (language and identity)."},{"t":"ex","problem":"Translate \"I am happy because I'm on holiday.\"","steps":["Happy now (a state) → estar; on holiday → estar de vacaciones"],"answer":"Estoy feliz porque estoy de vacaciones."}]},{"say":"Theme two, experiences, covers leisure, holidays, life stories, customs and migration. That means narrating the past.","blocks":[{"t":"key","text":"The preterite tells completed actions: fui a México, comí tacos, visitamos Toledo. The imperfect describes background and habits: era pequeño, siempre jugaba al fútbol, hacía sol."},{"t":"p","text":"Together: Cuando era niño (imperfect background), fui a España (preterite event). Time phrases help: ayer, el año pasado, hace dos años (preterite); siempre, a menudo, de niño (imperfect)."},{"t":"p","text":"Topics: actividades de ocio, vacaciones y viajes, ritos de paso, costumbres y tradiciones, migración."},{"t":"ex","problem":"Translate \"When I was young, I used to visit my grandparents every summer.\"","steps":["Habit in the past → imperfect: era, visitaba"],"answer":"Cuando era joven, visitaba a mis abuelos cada verano."}]}],[{"say":"Themes three and four cover technology, media, the arts, and how communities, education and work are organized.","blocks":[{"t":"key","text":"Human ingenuity: entretenimiento, expresiones artísticas, comunicación y medios, tecnología, innovación científica. Social organization: relaciones sociales, comunidad, educación, el mundo laboral, ley y orden."},{"t":"p","text":"Debate language: Por un lado… por otro lado… (on one hand… on the other), Sin embargo (however), Además (furthermore), Por lo tanto (therefore)."},{"t":"p","text":"The subjunctive after expressions of opinion, emotion and desire: Es importante que los jóvenes lean más. Quiero que mi colegio tenga más ordenadores. No creo que la tecnología sea mala."}]},{"say":"Theme five covers the environment, human rights, peace, equality and globalization, and the exam rewards clear, well-organized writing.","blocks":[{"t":"key","text":"Vocabulary: el medio ambiente, el cambio climático, la contaminación, los derechos humanos, la igualdad, la globalización. Future and conditional: Usaremos energía renovable (we will use); Deberíamos reciclar (we should recycle). Si clauses: Si todos reciclamos, habrá menos basura."},{"t":"p","text":"Paper 1 is writing in a text type (blog, email, article, speech, leaflet); match register and conventions (greeting, title, sign-off). Paper 2 tests listening and reading. The individual oral discusses a visual stimulus (SL) or literary extract (HL) linked to a theme."}]}]];
